Additionally, implement a class to represent the grimoire that can crystallize these rune harmonies, and a helper class to represent each harmony of runes. Ensure proper encapsulation and thread confinement of variables within the method, preventing any unintended side effects or data sharing between threads. The requirements are as follows:

